/Title (The Kove is situated in the heart of the Costa del Sol, representing one of the most exclusive and desirable enclaves in the province of Malaga. It is enveloped by nature while remaining mere minutes from the coast and the most appealing towns, offering an ideal balance of tranquility and connectivity. With sweeping views of both the mountains and the sea, it boasts an abundance of nearby amenities to fulfill all your daily requirements. Residing in The Kove means the world is at your fingertips: just 15 minutes from the beaches of Mijas Costa and Fuengirola, 25 minutes from Marbella, less than 30 minutes from the city of Malaga, and under half an hour from Malaga-Costa del Sol International Airport.)
