/Title (In recent years, I have observed a significant increase in the number of clients who view a second home in southern Spain primarily as an investment, or at least partially so, with a focus on return. This perspective markedly differs from that of individuals seeking a property for personal enjoyment. In the former scenario, the pertinent question becomes: "What factors must I consider when renting and/or reselling?")
