/Title (Compared to the previous year, rental prices in Marbella and Estepona have increased by an average of 9%. When compared to 2021, this represents a rise of over 45%. This data is derived from research conducted by Idealista*, a provider of property valuations in Spain. These rental prices are comparable to those in Ibiza; however, the purchase prices of properties in the Marbella region are significantly lower. This presents an advantageous opportunity for your return calculations!)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1193 0 R
