/Title (Rental permit, occupancy tax, law enforcement notification Spain is comprised of 17 autonomous regions, each possessing its own regulations concerning rentals. The majority of governments within these regions mandate that properties offered for rent obtain a rental license. To secure this license, a property must fulfill various criteria, including a residence permit, complaint forms, a first aid kit, a fire extinguisher, among others. Additionally, certain regions impose restrictions on rentals within apartment complexes or stipulate minimum rental durations, such as prohibiting rentals shorter than five days. In all instances, tenants must be registered at the police station by the owner \(or their representative\), similar to the procedure followed by hotels.)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1523 0 R
/Prev 1557 0 R
/Next 1582 0 R
>>
endobj
