/Title (Every property owner and all rented properties \(including apartments, storage units, and garage spaces\) are required to submit a tax return no later than 20 days following the conclusion of each quarter. This return is referred to as "modelo 210." Taxes must be remitted immediately upon submission. The deadlines for filing are January 20, April 20, July 20, and December 20. Spain does not permit a deferral period for tax return submissions. It is advisable to engage a tax specialist \(gestoria, asesoria\) to ensure that all tax obligations are fulfilled in compliance with Spanish tax regulations.)
